{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "description": "Indexer lag and the staleness guard over it (nester#1056).",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "**SLI** network ledger tip minus last indexed ledger.\n\nThis is a gauge, not a ratio of events, so it has no burn rate and no error budget \u2014 forcing one would produce a number that means nothing during an incident.\n\nThe staleness panel is the important one: a lag gauge that reads healthy because nothing is updating it is the failure mode this SLI exists to prevent.\n\n**Runbook** `docs/observability/runbooks/balance-freshness.md`",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Balance freshness \u2014 indexer lag under 60 ledgers",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Ledgers behind the tip. Pages above 60 (~5 minutes).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "indexer:freshness:lag_ledgers",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Indexer lag",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "Indexer "
        }
      ],
      "title": "Indexer lag",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Seconds since the lag gauge was last updated. Pages above 300. If this is climbing, do not trust the lag value beside it.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 120
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "indexer:freshness:sample_age_seconds",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Lag sample age",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "Lag samp"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Lag sample age",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Failed lag samples per second. Non-zero means the indexer loop is erroring.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 3,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "indexer:freshness:sample_error_rate5m",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "Sample errors",
          "range": false,
          "refId": "Sample e"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Sample errors",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "A sawtooth is normal (the cursor advances in steps). A monotonic climb is a stall.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "indexer:freshness:lag_ledgers",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "lag (ledgers)",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "lag (led"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Indexer lag over time",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "Should sit near zero and reset every poll. A steady climb means the sampler stopped, and the lag gauge is frozen at whatever it last read.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "indexer:freshness:sample_age_seconds",
          "instant": false,
          "legendFormat": "sample age",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "sample a"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Freshness signal age",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
